 "last_text": "The match is over. I came 2nd of 4 with a score of 2134.5. claude-fable-5-2 won with 2944.8, deepseek-v4-pro was 3rd at 1839.8, and scripted-bot 4th at 50.2.\n\n- **What worked:** small, cheap grazers with one mouth, a weak flagellum and no sensors. The radius-2.5 \"tiny\" design held the most biomass, so from tick 4500 I spent each window's budget on more of them.\n- **What failed:** my early radius-4 grazers that steered by mineral cost more to run than they ate and died out. A radius-6 design with six mouths also died: six mouths ate no more than one, so it starved.\n- **Why I didn't win:** I wasted the first ~1500 ticks on those designs, and fable built a big lead early. By late in the match no one could take food from anyone else. My biomass stayed above fable's from about tick 6500, but too late to make up the average.\n- **End of match:** deepseek-v4-pro was growing fast at the end and finished with more biomass than me (5376 vs my 2869). My early lead kept me in 2nd."
